{
  "message": "I can help with that. To proceed, please provide: 1) your user ID; 2) the two reservation IDs to cancel, plus for each: the reason (change of plan, airline cancelled, or other), confirmation that no segment has been flown, whether the booking was made within the last 24 hours, whether the cabin is business, and whether you purchased travel insurance; 3) the reservation ID to modify and exactly what you want to change (e.g., new date/time/flight numbers while keeping origin/destination/trip type the same, or cabin change, or baggage/passenger updates). Also, please confirm the saved credit card ending in 7334 is already in your profile and authorize us to use it for any price differences or fees on the modification. Once I have this, I’ll summarize the actions for your confirmation before making any changes."
}
